  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "FAK CLI & Dev-Tool Invocation Telemetry",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 6
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Every `fak` runtime verb and every private developer tool (`fak-flow`, `fak-sync`) emits one durable, best-effort usage row.** The public runtime plane is exposed by the `fak_fleet` exporter (`:9098`) as `fak_cli_*`; the private developer plane is exposed by `fak-ops-dashboard` (`:9101`) as `fak_tool_*`. Both are OBSERVED process self-reports (verb, exit code, wall-clock) \u2014 never a witness of downstream effect. Counts, flow, timing, and error bottlenecks live below.\n\nRows are redacted (salted argv digest, never raw argv) and the emitter is fail-open: a journal write can never change a tool's exit code. A missing journal reads as an honest empty fold, distinguished from an unreadable one by the `*_log_readable` gauge."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Runtime CLI invocations (fak_cli_* \u00b7 job fak_fleet)",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 11,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Invocation rows (window)",
      "description": "Total folded CLI-invocation rows retained by the exporter window. A 0 with fak_cli_usage_log_readable=1 means honestly no recent invocations; a readability of 0 means the journal could not be read.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 12,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 6
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "fak_cli_usage_rows_in_window{job=\"fak_fleet\"}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "No data",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "blue",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "mappings": []
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
